<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Usmani Glass '95/96 profit up 130 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Usmani Glass '95/96 profit up 130 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	  (In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>			    1995/96		1994/95</p>
<p>    Profit after tax  21.4	vs	 9.3</p>
<p>    Gross profit	43.6	vs	 17.6</p>
<p>    Net turnover	170.03    vs	 74.5</p>
<p>    Dividend	    25 taka on 100-taka share vs 25 taka.</p>
<p>(Note: The Usmani Glass Sheet Factory Ltd, which announced the annual results on Friday, said the higher profit was the outcome of substantial savings in gas and material usage following a modernisation and expansion programme in 1995. It also offered one rights share against one share held by the investors.)</p>
</text>
